bus.shopedit.price.default=Default price in this category: %s
bus.shopedit.unit_amount=Items per price
bus.shopedit.unit_amount.desc=2 means the price is for 2 items: at price 1, buying quantity 2 gives 4 items for 2. Leave empty for 1.
bus.shopedit.unit_amount_sell.desc=2 means the price is for 2 items: at price 1, selling quantity 2 takes 4 items and pays 2. Leave empty for 1.
